{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2025-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1751932800, "end_date": 1752623999, "month_true_total": 293, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:56:46 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "199889809", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072949033", "personaname": "Tokez30", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198072949033/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1876, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 185, "last_played": 1767919406, "avatar": "dbc3331ba193af054badca72f06234d2c43f9c68"}, "language": "english", "review": "game is a great sequel to the series", "timestamp_created": 1752614660, "timestamp_updated": 1752614660, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199881739", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006566481", "personaname": "SlowPlow", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SlowPlow/", "num_games_owned": 352, "num_reviews": 261, "playtime_forever": 399, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 368, "last_played": 1752609266, "avatar": "f67704bcfa5e1aa879bca1984f677fb3ec115a50"}, "language": "english", "review": "moar remmmant", "timestamp_created": 1752607417, "timestamp_updated": 1752607417, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199867941", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028644516", "personaname": "Admiral Cabbage", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bradburst45/", "num_games_owned": 1463, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 933, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 504, "last_played": 1753150736, "avatar": "b7066fb6ff81e0241bea7620e0bda9e06b669c13"}, "language": "english", "review": "First off, game needs a pause button. \n\nBUT nobody is talking about just how many ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ secrets this game has. This game is STACKED with secrets. There are over 60 unique weapons from your usual LMG's, shotguns, rifles, to bows, and even magic staffs. A lot I found just by really exploring. 10/10 environment design. Like Bloodborne I get lost just in the beauty and details of the castles, ♥♥♥♥ stained villages, ♥♥♥♥ stained sewers, jungles etc. \n\nObviously the instant recommendation is \"dark souls with guns\" but really feels like Kingsfield at time of this review with the amount of secret hunting I have been doing. And I am loving every second of it (minus some annoying enemies). \n\nPlease CEO of the entire game industry (Ik you are reading) add more secret hunting into games, it fuels my ADD ridden mouse neurons.", "timestamp_created": 1752595229, "timestamp_updated": 1752595229, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199862207", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045468592", "personaname": "SteveHybrid", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/stevehybrid/", "num_games_owned": 1417, "num_reviews": 1091, "playtime_forever": 18674, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9286, "last_played": 1767374599, "avatar": "b789d95fb6f6bc085250fcd32d186e19e61b13b9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Remnant II delivers an exceptional experience through its stunning visuals, intuitive controls, and rich gameplay depth that’s easy to pick up but rewarding to master. It supports a variety of playstyles, allowing players to approach challenges in ways that suit them best, whether through strategy or direct action, however each choice you make does impact the story and change the path of your game.\n\nThe story is compelling and well-written, and has so many choices for you to pick from making each playthrough unique and interesting. Complementing the narrative is a memorable soundtrack that perfectly captures the game's tone, enhancing every moment. With a generous amount of missions and quests, there’s always something engaging to do, making this a game that’s hard to put down. \n\n100% I'd recommend the game.", "timestamp_created": 1752590422, "timestamp_updated": 1752590422, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.596025466918945312", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199859250", "author": {"steamid": "76561198834226478", "personaname": "Sultan_90s", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198834226478/", "num_games_owned": 151, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 1692, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1540, "last_played": 1753515286, "avatar": "3ded4a7c2dadf67de9e6f9aeed0c4242058b3794"}, "language": "english", "review": "real game mode", "timestamp_created": 1752587843, "timestamp_updated": 1752587843, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800